Conclusion
In this lab, you implemented technical controls on a Linux workload aligned to SP 800-53 (AC-2, AC-3, AU-2, AU-12), deployed auditd, fail2ban, and AIDE, and validated system configuration using OpenSCAP. You then captured evidence artifacts, generated tamper-evident SHA-256 hashes, and mapped each artifact to its corresponding control in an evidence index. These skills directly support CGRC Domain 4 (Implementation) by demonstrating control deployment, and Domain 5 (Assessment/Authorization) by producing auditable, machine-readable evidence suitable for a security assessment package.
